{%- comment -%}
  One cell of the shared 2-column Specifications grid.

  A spec the feed didn't supply renders as an em dash rather than being
  dropped, so the table says "we don't know this" instead of quietly
  implying the stone has fewer attributes than it does.

  Accepts: label, value
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="product-spec">
  <span class="product-spec__label">{{ label }}</span>
  {%- if value != blank -%}
    <span class="product-spec__value">{{ value }}</span>
  {%- else -%}
    <span class="product-spec__value product-spec__value--unknown">&mdash;</span>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
